WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.480
It is the period of warring states.{these top three lines were from previous ep and should not be changed or edited}

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.840
The era of competing warlords.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:10.950
Many of these daimyou clashed blades ruthlessly, aiming for conquest of the country.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.800
One of them fights to regain his pride.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.580
One of them pursues the specter of his master.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.080
Yet another burns with desire for revenge.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.960
And another one unties bonds with his fists.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:30.960
The world falls once again into chaos.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:35.280
It will all lead up to Sekigahara.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.130
Men! We're moving out! {this needs to be more format, like something a military commander says to his troops}

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:08.500
Yeah! {OH FUCK, he's wearing the headdress}

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.070
H-Hey wait!

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:13.500
What're you doing?!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.660
Sasuke, perfect timing.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.670
We're heading out.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.540
Huh?

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.150
Where?

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:23.680
We're going to face Echigo's God of War, Uesugi Kenshin! {line break: Huh?!}

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.670
Huh?!

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:29.670
Astray

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.980
Follow me, men!

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.680
Yeah!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.500
Hey, what are you thinking?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.960
I've realized that only Oyakata-sama can rule Kai.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.320
So, how come we're confronting Uesugi? {the mmeaning should be - how did you jump from that reasoning to saying "we must fight uesugi"?}

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.430
Don't you understand?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:47.190
If none but Oyakata-sama can lead Kai, then I have to become his incarnation! {edit note: become the personification of him}

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:48.000
Huh?

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:53.700
And now that I <i>am</i> him, I must settle the 
score with his mortal enemy, Uesugi Kenshin!

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.280
Onwards!

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.970
Aw, come on!

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:17.010
This is Kawanakajima, where Oyakata-sama 
and Uesugi-dono crossed blades many times.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:18.470
Kawanakajima

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.220
If we cross the river, we'll be in Uesugi's domain. {If we cross the river, we'll be in Uesugi's domain. }

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.440
Is it snowing?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.250
General!

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.110
Uesugi-dono?

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:54.170
I knew you would come.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:57.990
Um, God of War, there's a really good reason for this— {there's certain reasons behind this--}

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:00.860
Sasuke, stand down! {Sasuke, don't interfere!}

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.410
General, are you serious?

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:06.310
If I wasn't serious, I wouldn't be here!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.810
Then, let's see you try. {Then, how about you try?}

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:16.740
Uesugi Kenshin, I challenge you to a duel! {Uesugi Kenshin, let us have a fair match!}

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.570
Very well.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.580
Show me the tiger inside you.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:25.080
Sanada Genjirou Yukimura!

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.230
I will fight in Oyakata-sama's stead!

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.580
This is the battle axe{軍配斧} that Oyakata-sama left to me!

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.030
Can you handle it?! {the meaning is more like "can you handle it?" but Yukimura woudlnt say something so provcative}

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.210
I won't let you escape!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.440
Doubt. {doubt or hesitation can both work here, which is better}{'doubt' seems to sound better, I think}

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:00.860
That is the only thing I feel from you when you wield that weapon.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.120
There is no doubt in me!

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.760
The Tiger of Kai is a great man.

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:46.930
Did you think you could replace him so easily?

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.700
I hadn't realized something so obvious... {check this whole convo}

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:59.210
While you've been close by his side, 
what have you seen of him? {I dont like this reptition "to him" "of him" can you reword it to get rid of that}

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:01.720
Nothing...

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.980
I saw nothing.

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.970
What did you learn?

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.480
Nothing...

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:17.220
I learned nothing.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:23.110
Then, what have you been doing?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.740
I've just, just...

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:32.290
been trying to follow him from behind.{check}{sure}

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.750
Oyakata-sama...

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.380
Young Tiger. {question, should Tiger be capitalized. I captilzed it becuase its used a sa direct address here, but its not capitalized anywhere else in the script}{I'd say yes, as it's being used as a title.}

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.140
Be ashamed of yourself.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:16.140
From that shame, you will grow. {That will be the way you grow up.} {this needs work}

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.750
And then, stand once more, {Then stand up once more,}

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:23.180
and take pride in yourself. {and be proud of yourself.}

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:27.620
Be proud that you are the one to whom the Tiger of Kai entrusted the Takeda.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.640
Oyakata-sama.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.960
The Tiger is not dead.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:44.030
Inside my heart, the Tiger I crossed blades with so many times lives on.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.690
Of course, his soul lives in you, too.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:56.660
Good grief... {something other than Jeez would be good}

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:01.420
Our general is quite a handful.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:07.380
The Uesugi will not get involved in the wars to the East and West. {should the directions be capitalized or what}{I would say yes, since it can be referring to the armies as well?}

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:12.980
And in the midst of battle, we will not attack you from behind.  {check}{背後を突く attack from behind}

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.640
I promise you that.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:22.370
I see.

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:24.820
The rest is up to me, right?

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:29.200
My Most Beautiful of Blades. {is this form of address specifically from the games? the capitalization looks weird to me}{I believe so, capitalised due to being a title}{The more I look at it, the more it seems it should be 'My Most Beautiful of Blades', as the whole thing is her title.}

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.840
Help them.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.750
To lead this war in the right direction.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:36.540
But...

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.500
Can I count on you, as always?

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.090
Kenshin-sama...

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:53.180
Kenshin-sama! Kenshin-sama!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.050
What's that?

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.280
Sasuke, I'm sorry.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.410
But I've made up my mind on at least one thing.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.030
I, Yukimura, will fight Tokugawa-dono.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:10.390
I will reclaim the pride of the Takeda of Kai. {I will get back the pride of the Takeda of Kai.}

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.400
So, you've finally found your resolve.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.120
But...

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.280
I know.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.040
The Takeda can't beat the Tokugawa as they are.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:22.470
In order to win, we must form an alliance with those who have similar interests.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:26.130
We must start by allying ourselves with Ishida-dono, who opposes Tokugawa.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:28.300
Basically, yeah.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:32.610
With that goal in mind, I was thinking of heading to Osaka Castle.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.680
Not a bad plan of action coming from you. {ike, sasuke didn't have any expectations)}

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:37.870
But, you're our general and you should wait here like one.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.110
The rest is our job.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.270
What are you going to do?

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.820
It's fine, leave it to me.

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:47.110
I have some reliable backup.

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.180
The ninja? {whoa i guess in this timeline he doesnt know who she is}

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.450
<i>Meanwhile,</i>

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:55.780
<i>Tokugawa Ieyasu was visiting Kobayakawa Hideaki, who uses Crow Castle as his headquarters.</i>

